  "bodyHash": "9a0b19e2ebbcceda",
  "content": "<p><del><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_10d982bc-2bb6-43ad-b25e-e087f7e7a062.png\" alt=\"节肢动物恐惧扩展\" width=\"840\" height=\"197\"></strong></del></p>\n<h2><strong>ArPhEx - 终极节肢动物恐怖+RPG模组，拥有强大的潜行Boss以及逼真的蜘蛛、昆虫、蜈蚣等。这是一个极度硬核的模组，以残酷的敌人和游戏后期内容为特色，面向敢于迎接挑战的玩家。</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>重大更新将于十月恢复。目前因忙于完成博士学位论文而过于繁忙</strong></span></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sQQPZQSEpS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://dcbadge.limes.pink/api/server/https://discord.gg/sQQPZQSEpS\" alt=\"\"></a></em></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">加入精彩的ArPhEx Discord服务器，获取未来功能的早期预告和测试版，同时可以提出建议并获得快速支持</span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sQQPZQSEpS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">https://discord.gg/sQQPZQSEpS</span></a></strong></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>新增：支持我的Mod开发已开启Patreon赞助计划，各层级会员享有独家永久特权！: <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/vallax/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/c/vallax/</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>重要 ⚠️</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a> 是必需的</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Optifine</strong> 会破坏盔甲渲染效果，推荐改用<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</strong></a>（+ Oculus用于着色器）</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>\"Iris/Oculus &amp; GeckoLib兼容\"</strong> 会破坏动画且在1.20.1版本中无需使用</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nyfs-spiders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nyf's Spiders（从1.20.1起，建议在1.20.1上使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nyfs-spiders-au-naturel-edit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:#3598db;\">此版本</a>以获得更好性能）</strong>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\">JEI</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\"><strong>Configured</strong></a>, 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-boss-boss-bars\">Miniboss Boss Bars</a> 推荐安装。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">如果您正在使用任何添加生物群系的Mod，我建议使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\">自然罗盘</a> 或调整生成率配置<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fConfigurations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处的说明</a></em>，因为该模组的实体主要在生物群系中生成。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">希望减少战斗强度来刷取末期矿物的玩家，最适合安装 <a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croparium-arphex\">Croparium</a> 模组</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Boss栏支持可通过 \"<a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-boss-boss-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">MiniBoss Boss Bars</a>\" 模组实现</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">许多精彩的Mod包都包含了ArPhEx，例如 <a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cave-horror-project\">洞穴恐怖计划</a> 和我的Mod包 <a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/hells\">地狱仙境</a>。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">我的其他一些Mod包括：<a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f5r2Gl3PWyoE%253fsi%253dEB9P3vkGUDuhLmEv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉迷者</a>, <a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zoniex\">僵尸噩梦扩展</a>，以及更多！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>主要功能包括：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基于现实生物的多样化、细致、逼真的全新节肢动物实体</strong></li>\n<li><strong>可在多个维度追踪玩家的梦魇风格恶魔Boss</strong></li>\n<li><strong>一个名为“爬行之地”的独特自定义维度，拥有专属实体和地图生成机制<br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>一个与末地传送门大小相当的克苏鲁风格最终Boss</strong></li>\n<li><strong>多个大型自定义地牢结构</strong></li>\n<li><strong>无数新物品、特殊武器、可驯服实体和各种工具</strong></li>\n<li><strong>真正的具有挑战性PvE体验，远超范妮拉游戏的后期内容</strong></li>\n<li><strong>大量配置选项，包含“疯狂模式”特性，使游戏玩法节奏更快（允许在Overworld中爬行维度的实体）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>定期增加更多疯狂内容的更新</strong></li>\n<li><strong>提供详尽说明的模组Wiki</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">ArPhEx Wiki链接：&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">arphex.miraheze.org</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><br><em>请注意，现实生活中这些节肢动物大多无害、被动，甚至对人类友好；本模组并不旨在准确反映它们的行为。</em></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#3598db\">由 <strong>Bisect Hosting</strong> 赞助 - 您想和朋友一起玩ArPhEx吗？BisectHosting 提供所有游戏服务器需求-新客户可使用代码<strong>PHOBIA</strong>节省第一个月的费用25%-全天候支持，带来流畅的游戏体验。支持我独自开发的这个模组！</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fphobia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"> </span></a></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fphobia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/21d8bbe0-05b3-4e75-b2e1-1de18f1b757a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></h4>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_7ed47c00-a7b5-4862-b9cc-876862c060f0.png\" width=\"539\"></strong></h2>\n<p><strong><em>警惕雷电</em></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n真实威猛且令人畏惧的自然力量——生存不会容易；这些强大实体就是死亡的化身，自然生成并拥有高级机制，能在长距离内追踪并恐吓你。建议使用远程武器（尽可能）和高移动力，因为这些怪物无处不在，没有安全之地。幻觉实体预示着它们稀少的出现，伴有闪电标记。它们也可被召唤，死亡时掉落强力物品，作为来自“爬行之地”的恶魔领主，表现为混合节肢动物的可怕形象。<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">蛛魔</span></h2>\n<p>Overworld-exclusive spawns during thunderstorms. Avoids spawning near players that have killed it at full power. Like the warden, this entity is something to run from, not try to kill until you become very strong.</p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252f2BQMH9r.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2BQMH9r.jpeg\" alt=\"Spider Moth Dweller Boss\" width=\"3360\" height=\"2100\"></a></h2>\n<p>[BOSS]</p>\n<p>Multiple phobias combine to create a nightmarish hybrid creature with an original design incorporating some elements of Mothman folklore.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wiki page:</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpider_Moth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spider_Moth</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">蝎之狂血</span></h2>\n<p>Nether-exclusive spawns during rain+thunderstorm cycles. Avoids spawning near players that have killed it, or haven't warded off the Spider Moth twice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252feQs0YrS.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eQs0YrS.jpeg\" width=\"3360\" height=\"2100\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;[BOSS]</p>\n<p>An ominous flying demonic entity that can stalk you in the nether, adding a true horror element there. Original design with hybrid elements of scorpion and mosquito morphology.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wiki page:</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fScorpioid_Bloodluster\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Scorpioid_Bloodluster</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">虚空德拉贡鞭挞者</span></h2>\n<p>End-exclusive spawns during rain+thunderstorm cycles. Avoids spawning near players that have killed it, or haven't warded off the Spider Moth twice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fMWzMPfq.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MWzMPfq.jpeg\" alt=\"Draconic Voidlasher\" width=\"2458\" height=\"1680\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;[BOSS]</p>\n<p>A horrifying demonic entity with telekinetic powers lurks in the end, following you with teleportations. Original design combines elements of tailless whip scorpion and dragonfly (meganeura) morphology.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wiki page:</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fDraconic_Voidlasher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Draconic_Voidlasher</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">蛛形三分神</span></h2>\n<p>Rare crawling-exclusive spawns on layer 2+4.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fMWzMPfq.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_fb021b66-b7a3-4a26-82ea-7a3381710ae4.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;[BOSS]</p>\n<p>A ruthless monstrosity with powers over time itself, this creature will make survival perilous for players at any game stage. Original design hybridising elements of trilobite (dicranurus) and spider (flic flac) morphology.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wiki page:</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fArachnoid_Trisector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Arachnoid_Trisector</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">迪巴洛斯毁灭者</span></h2>\n<p>Rare crawling-exclusive spawns on layer 3+4.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_d408b393-4d30-44ba-9414-142240122710.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;[BOSS]</p>\n<p>An extremely powerful demon lord with multiple cosmic powers, serving as the most terrifying threat outside of the Tormentor. Original design hybridising elements of giant centipede and diabolical ironclad beetle and scarab morphology.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wiki page:</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fDiabolos_Decimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Diabolos_Decimator</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">折磨者</span></h2>\n<p>Spawns anywhere once activated by either killing the original three bosses and encountering an initial version in the overworld, or summoning it from an altar on the bottom layer of the Crawling dimension. Can be sealed or killed with extreme difficulty.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fx3y0vwo.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x3y0vwo.jpeg\" alt=\"The TORMENTOR\" width=\"3309\" height=\"2047\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;[SUPERBOSS]</p>\n<p>A threat to eclipse the wither storm. The ultimate monstrosity, something not seen in any other horror mod: A true&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">biome-sized</span></strong> eldritch horror capable of tormenting all nearby players, and comes in multiple different tiers of power. This eldritch beast is so powerful that nothing else can compete, and it is more comparable to an infection mod than a single entity. However, it can be sealed (its primary target should throw a \"bane of the darkness\" item into a crawling portal), or defeated by some of the most powerful ranged weapons in ArPhEx after a long multi-day fight. No matter how strong you are, this entity will likely pose a major threat. Original design incorporates elements of various arthropods, especially house centipede, sea spider, scorpion, and mosquito aspects.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wiki page:</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fTORMENTOR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/TORMENTOR</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gZ6q6Sei4xtk2C3VCtAvwMkSOwrZ1kuLvfDlRCq97y8/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看所有生成信息/生物群系列表</a></p>\n<p><em>计划添加的内容：多达5阶的更多折磨者。即将到来的“蜘蛛房间”维度可能还有另一个Boss。计划进行主要的声音改进（目前尚未关注这些），以及对现有机制的一般进一步优化。</em></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_772093c2-f6cc-4697-8256-ad145a96119b.png\" width=\"1215\"></p><p>该模组包含一系列具有高精度细节的真实节肢动物生物，主要针对那些可能引起恐惧症的存在。其中大部分都较稀有，但很多都十分强大，所以请遇到它们时多加小心！</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>接下来的三个计划中的怪物添加：蝎子小头目，三叶虫，降落伞蜘蛛。持续改进现有的怪物。爬行和下层世界还有其他地牢计划。欢迎提出建议。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gZ6q6Sei4xtk2C3VCtAvwMkSOwrZ1kuLvfDlRCq97y8/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击查看所有生成信息/生物群系列表</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>当前：</strong></h2>\n<p>大多数已添加的怪物都可以攀爬墙壁。一些怪物可以大规模出现。一些是可以驯服的，或在特殊结构中出现。小头目按照从强到弱的顺序排列。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fjytMCrA.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jytMCrA.png\" alt=\"蜘蛛母系侧头目\" width=\"511\" height=\"319\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>蜘蛛母系 </strong><strong>[侧头目]</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于狼蛛</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpider_Matriarch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spider_Matriarch</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fuGiaECU.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvwZh8J.png\" alt=\"螃蟹限制器小头目\" width=\"511\" height=\"320\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>螃蟹限制器 </strong><strong>[小头目]</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于日本蜘蛛蟹</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCrab_Constrictor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Crab_Constrictor</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252f2TfNi2e.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2TfNi2e.png\" alt=\"黄蜂复仇者\" width=\"519\" height=\"361\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>黄蜂复仇者 </strong><strong>[小头目]</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于塔兰图拉鹰</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fWasp_Nemesis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Wasp_Nemesis</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fuGiaECU.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/phWHieu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"521\" height=\"365\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>蜘蛛入侵者 </strong><strong>[小头目]</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于六眼沙蜘蛛</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpider_Infestor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spider_Infestor</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fuGiaECU.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/COSylPz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"527\" height=\"403\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>板形蠕虫怪物 </strong><strong>[小头目]</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于史前板形蠕虫</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.mirahe