e\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpider_Obstructer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spider_Obstructer</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.3169%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252ftTxuuey.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Ex4KLQ.png\" alt \"蚂蚁\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>蚂蚁纵火者变体</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于火蚁种类</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAnt_Arsonist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Ant_Arsonist</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table style=\"width:100.129534%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.677544%\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hhjD40J.png\" alt \"白蚁挖掘者\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>白蚁挖掘者变体</strong></span></p>\n<p>设计基于Odontotermes Formosanus类型</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基百科页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fTermite_Tunneler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Termite_Tunneler</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.310085%\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">许多非标准怪物，如\"幻觉\"，血虫，海蜘蛛，棍节虫，捕蝇草等</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_bcbe0d43-0c05-42ad-b170-46848a405444.png\" width=\"565\"></strong></h2>\n<p>关于模组物品及其他详细信息。ArPhEx 包含许多物品，就像掉落它们的怪物一样疯狂！</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以在这里找到该模组的完整物品列表以及获取它们的所有信息（配方、掉落等）：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fItems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Items</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>此模组的物品过于复杂，无法在此完全描述，否则会因信息过载而拖累页面。</strong></p>\n<p>wiki 提供了有关所有怪物和物品的详细信息，还有指南！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>WIKI 物品分类链接：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aWeapons_and_Tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">武器与工具</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aOther_Items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他物品</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aBlocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aArmour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">护甲</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aInherent_Powers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">固有力量</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>以下是该模组中部分最强护甲和武器的预览！:</strong></p>\n<table style=\"width:100.129534%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.929495%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fOpW30t5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OpW30t5.png\" alt=\"Infernal Armour\" width=\"301\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>地狱护甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAbyssal_Blade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊之刃</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>wiki 页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fInfernal_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Infernal_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.073345%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fK6hMsFZ.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6hMsFZ.png\" alt=\"Spectral Armour\" width=\"302\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>幽灵护甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAscendant_Staff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">晋升法杖</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>wiki 页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpectral_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spectral_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.929495%\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Zb1uD9E.png\" alt=\"Juggernaut Armour\" width=\"343\" height=\"204\"></p>\n<p><strong>巨兽护甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fOblivion_Ray\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遗忘射线</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>wiki 页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fJuggernaut_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Juggernaut_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.073345%\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rE20bXu.png\" alt=\"Umbral Armour\" width=\"300\" height=\"213\"></p>\n<p><strong>幽影护甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fJudgement_Blaster\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">审判发射器</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>wiki 页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fUmbral_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Umbral_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.929495%\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3GL05Md.png\" alt=\"Spacetime Armour\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<p><strong>时空护甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fTemporospatial_Transmitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">时空传送器</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>wiki 页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpacetime_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spacetime_Armour</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.073345%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fZOXNCkn.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZOXNCkn.png\" alt=\"Eternal Armour\" width=\"371\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>永恒护甲（双持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAbyss_Ascendant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊晋升之刃</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>wiki 页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fEternal_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Eternal_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>祝您玩得愉快！</p>\n<h4><strong>ArPhEx 从一些最疯狂的模组中获得灵感，例如 Lycanite 的怪物、Orespawn 和 Chocolate Quest，同时还借鉴了 Terraria。</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_b816cb49-55f7-48a2-96e1-85df67dd4f3c.png\" width=\"1281\"></p>\n<p>ArPhEx 附带一个名为“爬行者”的特殊维度，拥有五种生物群系，四层区域需通过征服地下城来解锁。在爬行者和主世界中均会生成多种地下城主结构。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>【爬行者维度】</em></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GXEQzrO.jpeg\"></p>\n<p>这是一个美丽却又噩梦般的世界，只有适者生存。 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fThe_Crawling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爬行者</a>展现了自然界最为残酷与冷漠的一面——即使在最深层生存也极其危险，即便是最强的装备也难以为继。这里有五个生物群系和四个只能通过特殊地下城才能纵向穿越的区域，且这些地下城会引导你从一层进入下一层！同时还有危险的天气周期——血雨和浓雾可能随时降临。</p>\n<p>要进入这个维度，需要完成几个步骤：首先，您需要制作一个 \"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCrawling_Compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爬行罗盘</a>\"，它会将您引导至主世界上一个巨大的中央有球体的结构内。在这个球体内有四根支柱，您可以使用燃烧之焰点燃它们。点亮后只需右键点击中央的“爬行屏障”方块即可激活通往爬行者的传送门！</p>\n<p>要离开这个维度，您可以在顶层偶尔找到一些传送结构。其中三分之一由石头构成并带您回到主世界；三分之一由下界岩构成并带您到下界；还有三分之一由末地石构成并带您到末地维度。每次传送都会随机出现位置，因此每一次进入爬行者维度的冒险都充满危险。</p>\n<p>但更危险的是试图深入爬行者的底层！</p>\n<p>当您在维境内时，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCrawling_Compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爬行罗盘</a>可指引您当前层级的最近一座地下城（用于提升或降低层级）。按住 Shift 键右键点击可扫描向上的地下城。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>爬行者维度内的五种生物群系：</strong></p>\n<p>爬行树冠</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LwAsMLN.jpeg\"></p>\n<p>神秘复合物</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/suc4KZS.png\"></p>\n<p>奢靡沙漠</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yd73dyS.png\"></p>\n<p>网状废土</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PWTvV7Z.png\"></p>\n<p>受苦洞穴</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hLI4xSc.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>视频合集</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?si=fhEFGI0SEC8W5Vwr&list=PL2ZZY4UiOMQgcKe1kRxDlMQzieOydDdi1\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>我的视频</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xFgL33GHlsw?si=tGjMs_xHBkLk6VLX\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
